---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { AUTHOR_EMAIL, SITE } from '@/lib/site';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Saran Mahadev (Dev): creator, engineer, educator, builder and entrepreneur, and the person behind Drafted and Dev Universe.">
  <section class="wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:32px">
    <div class="mono muted" style="margin-bottom:14px"><a href="/">Home</a> / About</div>
    <h1 class="disp" style="font-size:clamp(72px,12vw,180px)">About me</h1>
  </section>
  <div class="wrap" style="padding-bottom:80px">
    <div class="prose" style="margin-left:0">
      <p>I am Saran Mahadev, and I go by Dev. I am a creator, engineer, educator, builder and entrepreneur.</p>

      <h2 id="what-i-do">What I do</h2>
      <p>I write about software engineering, AI and technology, productivity, systems, entrepreneurship and careers, and I build things that put those ideas to work. {SITE.title} is where I think in writing: the place for deep thinking and written knowledge.</p>

      <h2 id="how-i-got-here">How I got here</h2>
      <p>I once planned to prepare for UPSC and become an IPS officer. A substitute teacher explaining inheritance in a Computer Science class changed what I was curious about, and the rest followed from there. I tell that story in <a href="/curious-to-coder/symptoms-that-you-should-pursue-coding/">Symptoms That You Should Pursue Coding</a>.</p>

      <h2 id="dev-universe">Dev Universe</h2>
      <p>Learning, creating, teaching, sharing and building should not be disconnected activities. <a href="/dev-universe/a-connected-ecosystem/">Dev Universe</a> is the system I am building around that idea, and {SITE.title} is one part of it.</p>

      <h2 id="elsewhere">Elsewhere</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@saranmahadev">Saran Mahadev on YouTube</a>: technology, AI, software engineering, projects and tutorials.</li>
        <li><a href="https://www.instagram.com/everything.by.dev">Everything.by.Dev</a>: what is happening across Dev Universe.</li>
        <li><a href="https://www.instagram.com/lyf.as.dev">Lyf as Dev</a>: the personal side, who I am and how I live.</li>
        <li><a href="https://github.com/saranmahadev/blog">GitHub</a>: the source of every article on this site.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 id="say-hello">Say hello</h2>
      <p>Write to <a href={`mailto:${AUTHOR_EMAIL}`}>{AUTHOR_EMAIL}</a>, or open any post and send a private message. See the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a> for everything else.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
